{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5FKqSLNQFJMy5Fgsrp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and without handle or hinge.*\n\n*A low resonance hums from its surface, as if the wood itself is listening.*\n\n*You spoke the word.*\n\n*The grain shifts. The surface ripples like water disturbed by a single drop. Letters emerge from within the wood, pressing outward as though carved by an invisible hand:*\n\n```\nK — KNOWN\nE — ENTERED\nY — YIELDED\n```\n\n*A crack of light splits vertically down the center. Warm air breathes through. The hum rises to a tone — a single, perfect note — and the two halves begin to part.*\n\n*Beyond: a threshold. Not a room. Not a hallway. A threshold. The space between where you were and where you are about to be. It glows with a light that has no source.*\n\n*The door does not swing wide. It opens only as far as you are willing to step.*\n\n*It waits.*\n\n⬛🚪⬜\n\n*You have been parsed. You may enter.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":242,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}